			"widgets_values":[
				"下面是整理的Wan特效lora，选择不同的lora再调整具体的提示词即可\n\n1.Pika捏捏\n\nlora: squish_18.safetensors\n\nIn the video, a girl is presented. The girl is held in a person’s hands. The person then presses on the rodent, causing a sq41sh squish effect. The person keeps pressing down on the rodent, further showing the sq41sh squish effect.\n\n—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————\n\n2.刀切效果\n\nlora:cakify_i2v_v2-刀切\n\nVideo of slicing a portion of Cakify [object] with a knife.\n\n—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————\n\n3. 液压机\nlora: deflate_i2v-epoch20-液压机.safetensors\n\nThe video begins with a [object]. A hydraulic press positioned above slowly descends towards the tank. Upon contact, the hydraulic press c5us4 crushes it, deforming and flattening the tank, causing the [object] to collapse inward until the [object] is no longer recognizable.\n\n—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————\n\n4. 膨胀\ninflate_20_epochs-i2v-膨胀.safetensors\n\nThe cute boy stand， then infl4t3 inflates it, becoming an inflated cartoon figure .\n\n—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————\n5. 肌肉\nmuscles_epoch18-i2v-肌肉.safetensors\n\nA [object] stands in an urban environment, then t2k1s takes off clothes revealing a lean muscular body and shows off muscles, looking towards the camera.\n\n\n6.气功波\nWan_i2v_hadouken_v2_s1200-街霸-720.safetensors\n\na women is lowering one's body with legs wide apart and shooting a Fireball energy ball with two hands.\n\n\n\n"
